async function loadPurchasesModule(){if(!activeBusinessId)return;message("globalMessage","جارٍ تحميل الموردين وفواتير المشتريات...");const [pr,ir]=await Promise.all([
 client.from("parties").select("id,name,company,phone,kind").eq("business_id",activeBusinessId).in("kind",["supplier","both"]).order("name"),
 client.from("purchase_invoices").select("id,invoice_no,supplier_id,supplier_name_snapshot,invoice_date,total,paid_total,due_total,status").eq("business_id",activeBusinessId).order("invoice_date",{ascending:false}).limit(200)
]);if(pr.error)return fail(pr.error);if(ir.error)return fail(ir.error);suppliers=pr.data||[];purchaseInvoices=ir.data||[];renderSuppliers();renderPurchaseInvoices();fillPurchaseSuppliers();message("globalMessage","");}
async function saveSupplier(e){e.preventDefault();if(!permission("parties.create"))return;const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),payload={business_id:activeBusinessId,kind:"supplier",name:String(f.get("name")).trim(),company:String(f.get("company")||"").trim()||null,phone:String(f.get("phone")||"").trim()||null,address:String(f.get("address")||"").trim()||null,notes:String(f.get("notes")||"").trim()||null};message("globalMessage","جارٍ حفظ المورد...");const {error}=await client.from("parties").insert(payload);if(error)return fail(error);e.currentTarget.reset();show("supplierEditor",false);await loadPurchasesModule();message("globalMessage","تم حفظ المورد.");}
function renderSuppliers(){const balancesMap={};if(permission("parties.view")){client.from("party_account_balances").select("party_id,purchases_total,supplier_payments,supplier_net_balance").eq("business_id",activeBusinessId).then(({data,error})=>{if(error){console.warn(error);return;} (data||[]).forEach(x=>balancesMap[x.party_id]=x);$("suppliersRows").innerHTML=suppliers.map(s=>{const b=balancesMap[s.id]||{};return '<tr><td><strong>'+esc(s.name)+'</strong><small>'+esc(s.company||"")+'</small></td><td>'+esc(s.phone||"—")+'</td><td>'+money(b.purchases_total)+'</td><td>'+money(b.supplier_payments)+'</td><td>'+money(b.supplier_net_balance)+'</td><td><button class="tiny secondary" data-statement="'+s.id+'">عرض</button></td></tr>';}).join("")||'<tr><td colspan="6">لا يوجد موردون مسجلون.</td></tr>';bindSupplierStatements();});}else $("suppliersRows").innerHTML='<tr><td colspan="6">لا توجد صلاحية عرض أرصدة الموردين.</td></tr>';}
function bindSupplierStatements(){$("suppliersRows").querySelectorAll("[data-statement]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>loadSupplierStatement(suppliers.find(s=>s.id===b.dataset.statement))));}
async function loadSupplierStatement(s){if(!s||!permission("parties.view"))return;message("globalMessage","جارٍ تحميل كشف الحساب...");const [br,sr]=await Promise.all([client.from("party_account_balances").select("supplier_net_balance,purchases_total,supplier_payments").eq("business_id",activeBusinessId).eq("party_id",s.id).maybeSingle(),client.from("party_account_statement").select("entry_type,reference_no,entry_date,debit,credit,description").eq("business_id",activeBusinessId).eq("party_id",s.id).order("entry_date",{ascending:true})]);if(br.error)return fail(br.error);if(sr.error)return fail(sr.error);$("statementTitle").textContent="كشف حساب: "+s.name;$("statementBalance").textContent="إجمالي المشتريات: "+money(br.data?.purchases_total)+" · المدفوع: "+money(br.data?.supplier_payments)+" · المستحق للمورد: "+money(br.data?.supplier_net_balance);const labels={opening_balance:"رصيد افتتاحي",purchase_invoice:"فاتورة مشتريات",payment:"دفعة"};$("statementRows").innerHTML=(sr.data||[]).map(x=>'<tr><td>'+esc(x.entry_date)+'</td><td>'+esc(labels[x.entry_type]||x.entry_type)+'</td><td>'+esc(x.reference_no||"—")+'</td><td>'+money(x.debit)+'</td><td>'+money(x.credit)+'</td><td>'+esc(x.description||"")+'</td></tr>').join("")||'<tr><td colspan="6">لا توجد حركات حساب.</td></tr>';show("supplierStatement",true);message("globalMessage","");}
function fillPurchaseSuppliers(){const sel=$("purchaseSupplier");sel.innerHTML='<option value="">اختر المورد</option>'+suppliers.map(s=>'<option value="'+s.id+'">'+esc(s.name)+'</option>').join("");}
function openPurchaseForm(){if(!permission("purchases.create"))return message("globalMessage","ليس لديك صلاحية إنشاء فاتورة مشتريات.");$("purchaseForm").reset();$("purchaseDate").value=today();$("purchaseItems").innerHTML="";purchaseLineCount=0;addPurchaseLine();show("purchaseEditor",true);$("purchaseEditor").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});}
function addPurchaseLine(selectedId=""){const id="purchaseLine"+(++purchaseLineCount);const options=products.map(p=>'<option value="'+p.id+'" '+(p.id===selectedId?"selected":"")+'>'+esc(p.name)+(p.code?" · "+esc(p.code):"")+'</option>').join("");const el=document.createElement("div");el.className="purchase-line";el.dataset.line=id;el.innerHTML='<div class="line-head"><strong>بند '+purchaseLineCount+'</strong><button type="button" class="tiny secondary" data-remove-line>حذف</button></div><label>المنتج<select data-field="product_id" required><option value="">اختر منتجًا</option>'+options+'</select></label><div class="form-grid"><label>الكمية<input data-field="quantity" type="number" min="0.001" step="0.001" value="1" required></label><label>تكلفة الوحدة قبل الخصم<input data-field="unit_price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required></label></div><button type="button" class="tiny secondary" data-add-product>+ منتج جديد داخل الفاتورة</button>';el.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",updatePurchaseTotals));el.querySelector("[data-remove-line]").addEventListener("click",()=>{el.remove();updatePurchaseTotals();});el.querySelector("[data-add-product]").addEventListener("click",()=>{window.pendingPurchaseLine=el;show("inlineProductEditor",true);$("inlineProductEditor").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});});$("purchaseItems").appendChild(el);updatePurchaseTotals();}
function updatePurchaseTotals(){const lines=[...$("purchaseItems").querySelectorAll(".purchase-line")];let subtotal=0;for(const l of lines){const q=Number(l.querySelector('[data-field="quantity"]').value||0),p=Number(l.querySelector('[data-field="unit_price"]').value||0);subtotal+=q*p;}const discount=Number($("purchaseForm").elements.supplier_discount.value||0),total=subtotal-discount,paid=Number($("purchaseForm").elements.paid_amount.value||0);$("purchaseTotals").textContent="الإجمالي قبل الخصم: "+money(subtotal)+" · الخصم: "+money(discount)+" · الصافي: "+money(total)+" · المتبقي: "+money(total-paid);if(discount>subtotal||paid>total||discount<0||paid<0)$("purchaseTotals").style.color="#a33";else $("purchaseTotals").style.color="";}
async function saveInlineProduct(e){e.preventDefault();if(!permission("products.create"))return message("globalMessage","ليس لديك صلاحية إنشاء منتج.");const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),p={business_id:activeBusinessId,name:String(f.get("name")).trim(),code:String(f.get("code")||"").trim()||null,category:String(f.get("category")||"").trim()||null,unit:String(f.get("unit")||"قطعة").trim(),wholesale_price:Number(f.get("wholesale_price")||0),retail_price:Number(f.get("retail_price")||0),minimum_stock:Number(f.get("minimum_stock")||0),warranty:String(f.get("warranty")||"").trim()||null,warranty_provider:String(f.get("warranty_provider")||"").trim()||null,specs:String(f.get("specs")||"").trim()||null};if([p.wholesale_price,p.retail_price,p.minimum_stock].some(n=>!Number.isFinite(n)||n<0))return message("globalMessage","راجع الأسعار وحد التنبيه.");message("globalMessage","جارٍ إضافة المنتج للكتالوج...");const {data,error}=await client.from("products").insert(p).select("id").single();if(error)return fail(error);await loadProducts();const line=window.pendingPurchaseLine;if(line){const sel=line.querySelector('[data-field="product_id"]');sel.value=data.id;}window.pendingPurchaseLine=null;e.currentTarget.reset();show("inlineProductEditor",false);message("globalMessage","تمت إضافة المنتج للكتالوج فقط؛ لم تُسجل كمية بالمخزون.");}
async function savePurchase(e){e.preventDefault();if(!permission("purchases.create"))return;const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),lines=[...$("purchaseItems").querySelectorAll(".purchase-line")].map(l=>({product_id:l.querySelector('[data-field="product_id"]').value,quantity:Number(l.querySelector('[data-field="quantity"]').value),unit_price:Number(l.querySelector('[data-field="unit_price"]').value)}));if(!lines.length||lines.some(x=>!x.product_id||!Number.isFinite(x.quantity)||x.quantity<=0||!Number.isFinite(x.unit_price)||x.unit_price<0))return message("globalMessage","راجع المنتجات والكميات وتكاليف الوحدات في البنود.");const subtotal=lines.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.quantity*x.unit_price,0),discount=Number(f.get("supplier_discount")||0),paid=Number(f.get("paid_amount")||0);if(!f.get("supplier_id"))return message("globalMessage","اختر المورد.");if(discount<0||discount>subtotal||paid<0||paid>subtotal-discount)return message("globalMessage","الخصم أو المبلغ المدفوع غير صحيح.");message("globalMessage","جارٍ ترحيل فاتورة المشتريات وتحديث المخزون...");const {data,error}=await client.rpc("post_purchase",{p_business_id:activeBusinessId,p_invoice_no:String(f.get("invoice_no")).trim(),p_supplier_id:f.get("supplier_id"),p_invoice_date:f.get("invoice_date")||today(),p_items:lines,p_supplier_discount:discount,p_paid_amount:paid,p_notes:String(f.get("notes")||"").trim()||null});if(error)return fail(error);show("purchaseEditor",false);message("globalMessage","تم ترحيل الفاتورة بنجاح. رقم العملية: "+data);await Promise.all([loadProducts(),loadPurchasesModule()]);}
function renderPurchaseInvoices(){const q=$("purchaseSearch").value.trim().toLowerCase(),rows=purchaseInvoices.filter(x=>(x.invoice_no+" "+(x.supplier_name_snapshot||"")).toLowerCase().includes(q));$("purchasesRows").innerHTML=rows.map(x=>'<tr><td>'+esc(x.invoice_no)+'</td><td>'+esc(x.invoice_date)+'</td><td>'+esc(x.supplier_name_snapshot||"—")+'</td><td>'+money(x.total)+'</td><td>'+money(x.paid_total)+'</td><td>'+money(x.due_total)+'</td><td>'+esc(x.status)+' '+(Number(x.due_total)>0&&permission("payments.create")?'<button class="tiny" data-pay="'+x.id+'">تسجيل دفعة</button>':"")+'</td></tr>').join("")||'<tr><td colspan="7">لا توجد فواتير مشتريات.</td></tr>';$("purchasesRows").querySelectorAll("[data-pay]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>openSupplierPayment(purchaseInvoices.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.pay))));}
function openSupplierPayment(inv){if(!inv||!permission("payments.create"))return;const f=$("supplierPaymentForm");f.reset();f.elements.invoice_id.value=inv.id;f.elements.amount.max=inv.due_total;f.elements.payment_date.value=today();$("paymentTitle").textContent="دفعة للمورد · الفاتورة "+inv.invoice_no+" · المتبقي "+money(inv.due_total);show("paymentEditor",true);$("paymentEditor").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});}
async function saveSupplierPayment(e){e.preventDefault();if(!permission("payments.create"))return;const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),amount=Number(f.get("amount"));if(!Number.isFinite(amount)||amount<=0)return message("globalMessage","أدخل مبلغًا صحيحًا.");message("globalMessage","جارٍ تسجيل دفعة المورد...");const {data,error}=await client.rpc("record_invoice_payment",{p_business_id:activeBusinessId,p_invoice_type:"purchase",p_invoice_id:f.get("invoice_id"),p_amount:amount,p_payment_date:f.get("payment_date")||today(),p_method:f.get("method"),p_reference:String(f.get("reference")||"").trim()||null,p_notes:String(f.get("notes")||"").trim()||null});if(error)return fail(error);show("paymentEditor",false);message("globalMessage","تم تسجيل الدفعة وتحديث مستحقات المورد.");await loadPurchasesModule();}


